cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use DIGDA-2D in your research, please cite the software using
  the citation information provided here. Please also cite the associated
  scientific paper once it has been published.
title: "DIGDA-2D"
abstract: >-
  DIGDA-2D applies independent, vertically resolved one-dimensional
  sediment diagenesis columns across a two-dimensional horizontal ocean grid.
  The 2D designation describes the horizontal distribution of columns and
  boundary conditions, not two-dimensional transport within sediments.
  The software simulates sediment composition and burial fluxes and provides
  optional carbon-isotope configurations.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kobayashi
    given-names: Hidetaka
repository-code: "https://github.com/hidekoba/DIGDA-2D_F90"
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - sediment diagenesis
  - ocean biogeochemistry
  - marine sediments
  - Fortran
  - MPI
  - carbon isotopes
